msgid ""
"SeExpr scripts allow you to render dynamically generated textures. They are "
"saved as .se files. They can be used as fill for generated layers."
msgstr ""
"Els scripts en SeExpr permeten renderitzar textures generades dinàmicament. "
"Es desen com a fitxers ``.se``. Es poden utilitzar com a emplenament de les "
"capes generades."

